   "group": "Language",
   "name": "Read aloud and voices",
   "what": "Any text can be read aloud with a voice you pick, from the element menu or the accessibility tools. Secrets are never read.",
   "here": "Right-click any text and choose Read aloud, or pick a voice in Settings, Sound and voice. Uses your browser's own voices.",
